#  RW-WPS authored authority for ECMWF open-data GRIB2 (IFS oper and AIFS
#  single, 0.25-degree lat-lon).  Authored from real 2026-08-16/17 00Z bytes
#  through grib2_inventory: the soil column rides generalized surface 151 by
#  ordinal pair (sot 2-3-18, vsw 2-0-25) carried in the Level1/Level2
#  columns, 2 m humidity is published as dewpoint (the ecmwf map-source rule
#  derives RH), and terrain is the surface geopotential (SOILGEO -> SOILHGT
#  rule).  GRIB1 columns carry the t128 analogues so the parser admits the
#  rows; this table is authored for the GRIB2 products.  AIFS matches a
#  subset: no pressure-level RH (use --use-spechumd yes) and two soil
#  ordinals.
